<h1>1. A sixteen-turn live DecisionHotelGraph replay</h1>
<p>Read this first. This is a complete passing provider-backed run with <code>HOTEL_GRAPH_CURRENT_DATE</code> frozen to <code>2027-07-15</code>. It exercises both model conversation and typed decision providers. Model wording can vary; normalized criteria, decision boundaries, hotel results, and completion are the durable contracts.</p>

<h2 id="run-it-yourself">Run it yourself</h2>
<pre><code class="language-bash">cd ezgraph-demo
USE_ENV=1 KEEP_SESSION=1 npm run test2:decision-hotel-graph</code></pre>
<p>The test sends all sixteen turns through one session, semantically judges every reply, and verifies the final durable booking state. It runs only with configured providers.</p>

<h2 id="captured-live-transcript">Captured live transcript</h2>
<div class="quote-replay">
  <div class="quote-replay__header"><span class="quote-replay__dots" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><a href="https://github.com/picoflowio/ezgraph-demo/blob/main/test/decision-hotel-graph/decision-hotel-graph.scenario.json">test/decision-hotel-graph/decision-hotel-graph.scenario.json</a><span>16 turns · passing live E2E</span></div>
  <ol class="quote-replay__list">
  {%- for turn in replay.turns %}
    <li class="quote-replay__turn{% if turn.completed %} quote-replay__turn--completed{% endif %}">
      <p class="quote-replay__meta">{{ loop.index }} · {{ turn.stage }}{% if turn.completed %} · completed{% endif %}</p>
      <div class="quote-replay__message quote-replay__message--you"><span class="quote-replay__who">You</span><div class="quote-replay__bubble">{{ turn.user | escape }}</div></div>
      <div class="quote-replay__message quote-replay__message--bot"><span class="quote-replay__who">Bot</span><div class="quote-replay__bubble">{{ turn.bot | renderTranscriptMarkdown | safe }}</div></div>
    </li>
  {%- endfor %}
  </ol>
</div>

<p>The replay includes an invalid date, inverted budget, cross-node date correction, criteria review, empty search, budget recovery, grounded hotel results, and a validated booking.</p>

